[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cnpc0ross0001"]

; The INVESTIGATOR (EscortA) - one of the two who walk the witness to the
; cells. Through the interrogation glass he lets slip that he logged the case
; file into evidence on the hidden weighted shelf (heard_evidence_tip).
; Escorts out at ~1:30, ends at the cell door. (The PLAYER is the detective,
; so this one is the "investigator" to avoid a name clash.)

